{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Could not prevail against him.</b> Because of Jacob's great constant clinging to the blessed El in thought and speech." "<b>And he struck.</b> He made known to him the future sin of those who would lead his people, and in his distress over this his speech faltered — <b>and the socket of</b> his thigh <b>was displaced, as he wrestled</b> with him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:02.628897376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}